      "requestedChange": "Revise the diamond sequencing to preserve access through the establishment process—for example, duck the first diamond round from both hands, then lead the remaining diamond toward dummy's honors, preserving CA for the established suit. Explain the continuation when defenders take or duck DA."
    }
  ],
  "advisorySuggestions": []
}

